    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;OH?ME&quot;</strong> \u2013 <strong>A journey to find yourself in a maze where memory and reality intertwine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When familiar streets and alleys fragment, and the past merges with the present, you\u2019ll wander through a space that feels both unreal and real.<br>This is a pixel-art puzzle game about growth, memories, and farewells. You play as a ghost, suspended between reality and recollection, exploring the houses, streets, and unsaid words from your past. The maze-like map is filled with traces of your childhood, and objects and scenes serve as vessels for time. Hidden clues guide you toward different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may walk steadily into the future, find warmth in memories, or lose yourself in the cracks of time\u2026 but no matter the path, the journey\u2019s end depends on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The past is never finished, and the future has yet to begin.&quot; \u2013 Are you ready to set out?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;OH?ME&quot;</strong> \u2013 <strong>A journey to find yourself in a maze where memory and reality intertwine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When familiar streets and alleys fragment, and the past merges with the present, you\u2019ll wander through a space that feels both unreal and real.<br>This is a pixel-art puzzle game about growth, memories, and farewells. You play as a ghost, suspended between reality and recollection, exploring the houses, streets, and unsaid words from your past. The maze-like map is filled with traces of your childhood, and objects and scenes serve as vessels for time. Hidden clues guide you toward different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may walk steadily into the future, find warmth in memories, or lose yourself in the cracks of time\u2026 but no matter the path, the journey\u2019s end depends on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The past is never finished, and the future has yet to begin.&quot; \u2013 Are you ready to set out?</strong></p>",
